---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro'
import DayRating from '../../rateDay/rateDay.astro'

export const post = {
  day: 5,
  title: 'Day 5',
  date: '2026-09-10',
  description: 'Fifth day, of daily',
  category: 'Daily',
  tags: ['Astro', 'Tailwind CSS', 'Web Development'],
}
---

<Layout>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-24 pt-32">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-16">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-sm">
        <span
          class="font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--secondary)]"
        >
          {post.category}
        </span>

        <span class="text-[var(--border)]">/</span>

        <span class="text-[var(--muted)]">
          Day {post.day}
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="mt-6 text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl"
      >
        {post.title}
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
        {
          new Date(post.date).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
            day: 'numeric',
            month: 'long',
            year: 'numeric',
          })
        }
      </p>

      <p
        class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-[var(--secondary)] pl-5 text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--muted)] sm:text-xl"
      >
        {post.description}
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="space-y-14 leading-8">
      <!-- Section -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
          What I did today?
        </h2>
        <p>
          I did my morning habits, after that I install new app at my iPad that
          allow me to write code on it and push it to my blog, without using
          computer, I don't think it's better because I don't have Bluetooth
          mouse to my iPad and editing code, using my fingers was weird, but at
          least if I'll practice I can do it everywhere, I'm still learning this
          new program but It works so I can recommend it name of that app is
          "Code app", later I went to work where I listened another audiobook,
          named "Lean startup method" I didn't finish it yet, but I'm thinking
          about create my own company, so It can help me achieve that goal, I'll
          write more details about this book, after I end It, As I wrote
          yesterday I bought book version of "think and grow rich" I think, this
          book is too hard to understand everything just from listening. I even
          got idea for business but It's a secret, I hope it's possible idea,
          and I'll earn more than I'll pay, If after my calculations I'll decide
          it's not worth I'll find another one,
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section class="py-5">
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        Plans for tomorrow
      </h2>

      <p>
        I'll do my habits , I'll calculate if my idea is good, I'll go to work,
        and I won't read another audiobook, because I'll listen podcast to
        listen some English
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Section -->
    <section>
      <h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">
        How I rate this day
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p>
          I'll give 8/10, I did everything I planed and I couldn't do much more
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <DayRating class="w-full" rating={8} />
  </article>
</Layout>
